&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; text-align: left; text-indent: 42px"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 24px; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
</jpcrp_cor:AcquisitionsByResolutionOfShareholdersMeetingTextBlock>
